# Engineered Explosives with two charge counters, sacrificed as its own
# cost: Count$CardCounters.CHARGE reads the host Java's ability kept, the
# moved-from object with its counters (GameAction.changeZone makes a new
# Card for the graveyard), so it destroys the mana value 2 Bears and
# Pacifism, not the mana value 0 Ornithopter. L2: same as Java.
startturn human
advance 3
queue paygeneric U
queue paygeneric U
